{"strongs": "H6938", "word": "קֵדָר", "translit": "qe.dar", "root": "קדם", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, of a people", "gloss": "swarthy? black", "definition": "קֵדָר proper name, of a people ( swarthy? black -tented?); Κηδαρ : 1. tribe of nomads in Arabian desert Isa 21:16 ; Isa 42:11 (with verb feminine), Isa 60:7 , Jer 2:10 ; Jer 49:28 (twice in verse); Ezek 27:21 ׳ בְּנֵיקֿ Isa 21:17 ׳ אָהֳלֵי ק Ps 120:5 ; Song 1:5 (made of black goat-skins Jacob Beduinenleben (2), 41 or black woven stuff Doughty Arab. Des. i. 224 f. ; simile of swarthy hue). 2. ancestor of 1 , son of Ishmael, Gen 25:13 = 1Chr 1:29 . — compare Assyrian †idru COT Gen 25:13 , Plin NH see 11 (12) Cedrei ; also Sabean tribe-name קדר Hal 623 (compare DHM ZMG xxxvii (1883), 14 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7319')\">BDB7319</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6938')\">H6938</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7318')\">BDB7318</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7320')\">BDB7320</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קֵדָר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a people</b> (<highlight>swarthy? black</highlight>-tented?); <grk>Κηδαρ</grk>: <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> tribe of nomads in Arabian desert <ref ref=\"Isa 21:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,21,16)\">Isa 21:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 42:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,11)\">Isa 42:11</ref> (with verb feminine), <ref ref=\"Isa 60:7\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,7)\">Isa 60:7</ref>, <ref ref=\"Jer 2:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,10)\">Jer 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,28)\">Jer 49:28</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"b